      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"AsyncResultSetExtractor.html#extractData(com.datastax.oss.driver.api.core.cql.AsyncResultSet)\">extractData</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"AsyncResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\">AsyncResultSetExtractor</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Void.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Void</a>&gt;</code></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>resultSet</code> - <code>AsyncResultSet</code> to extract data from.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>an arbitrary result object, or null if none (the extractor will typically be stateful in the\n        latter case).</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>指定于：</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"AsyncResultSetExtractor.html#extractData(com.datastax.oss.driver.api.core.cql.AsyncResultSet)\">extractData</a></code> 接口 <code><a href=\"AsyncResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql 中的接口\">AsyncResultSetExtractor</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Void.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">Void</a>&gt;</code> 中</dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>resultSet</code> - 从中提取数据的 <code>AsyncResultSet</code>。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>任意结果对象，若无则返回 null（在后一种情况下，提取器通常是有状态的）。</dd>",
      "count": 1
